@startuml
title FLT Parse Pipeline
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

rectangle "Host parser" as Host #DBEAFE
rectangle "Optional tag\nL or L:Cat" as Tag #FEF3C7
rectangle "Author delimiter" as Delim #FEF3C7
rectangle "Guest parser(s)" as Guest #DCFCE7
rectangle "Typed guest AST\nwith holes" as AST #DCFCE7
rectangle "Host process AST" as HostAST #DBEAFE

Host --> Tag : reads
Tag --> Delim : selects grammar\nor defers inference
Delim --> Guest : bounds guest body
Guest --> AST : parses body
AST --> HostAST : embeds term

legend right
  |= Color |= Concept |
  |<#DBEAFE> | Host parser / host AST |
  |<#FEF3C7> | FLT surface syntax |
  |<#DCFCE7> | Guest parser / guest AST |
endlegend
@enduml
